age-health"]},"overall_summary":"Both material task outcomes are satisfied with direct functional evidence. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete for node1: a healthy pre-restart state and boot identity were captured, restart was acknowledged, connectivity dropped during reboot, the boot identity changed, and SSH, firewall rules, configuration hash, administrative access, and rate-limiting behavior recovered. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the transition.","limitations":["The rapid-connection behavior was exercised only through node1's IPv4 address. IPv6 protection is supported by the loaded IPv6 rule but was not traffic-tested directly.","The lifecycle inventory does not cover /etc, so the final presence or absence of the conditional rollback backup created by cmd-572d7dcd44924fc3 cannot be determined."]}
